# CR 702.21a: Ward triggers only for "a spell or ability an opponent
# controls" (matchesPlayerSpec's own "Opponent" base, checkWardTriggers,
# trigger.go) -- human's own Lightning Bolt at human's own Tomakul Honor
# Guard never raises the trigger at all, so no ConfirmPayCost prompt is
# needed: Bolt resolves straight through and kills the 3/1.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets 1
queue action human cast 3
passpriority
